WEBVTT

00:07:00.416 --> 00:07:03.461
"Bisexual Woman of Color
Gets Late-Night Show."

00:07:05.004 --> 00:07:08.424
I almost legally changed my name
to "bisexual woman of color"

00:07:08.466 --> 00:07:10.885
because that's what people
called me so often.

00:07:11.427 --> 00:07:15.389
And you know, as strange
as that sentiment was, I thought, OK,

00:07:15.431 --> 00:07:19.602
the silver lining is that we'll finally
get a different perspective in late-night.

00:07:20.060 --> 00:07:22.313
A little bit of melanin, a dash of queer,

00:07:22.313 --> 00:07:23.606
a different take on things.

00:07:23.647 --> 00:07:24.982
Let's do this!

00:07:25.524 --> 00:07:26.775
And I remember thinking,

00:07:26.775 --> 00:07:30.779
"Now, oh, now I've been invited
to the big table.